OL,3,GNEWSAFour men guilty of murdering
OL,4,Afather-of-two
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men from Keighley have been found
OL,7,Fguilty of the murder of a father-of-two
OL,8,Fwho died in hospital three days after
OL,9,Fhe was attacked.
OL,11,FSuhail Choudry, 35, died after a group
OL,12,Fof men attacked him with metal and
OL,13,Fwooden bars in Flasby Street, Keighley,
OL,14,Fin the early hours of 8 February.
OL,16,FHe suffered catastrophic head and brain
OL,17,Finjuries and was taken to hospital,
OL,18,Fwhere he later died.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
