OL,3,GNEWSAFour men guilty of murdering
OL,4,Afather-of-two
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Sheffield Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,7,FRashid Hussain, 41, of Redcliffe
OL,8,FStreet, Mohammed Khan, 24, and Faisal
OL,9,FKhan, 26, both of Malsis Road, and
OL,10,FMajid Hussain, 42, of Devonshire
OL,11,FStreet, were found guilty of murder,
OL,12,Fviolent disorder and possession of an
OL,13,Foffensive weapon.
